% Test particles on a cold epicycle in the 3D shearing box (BOX_SHEARING=3), Omega = 1, L = 1, q = 3/2, for 2 epicycles.
% The test overrides InitCondFile and OutputDir. Masses are negligible (1e-12, G = 1): self-gravity is
% switched on only for the tree walk, the jerk and the Hermite machinery it feeds.
InitCondFile                       shearing_box_nbody_ics
OutputDir                          output
TimeMax                            12.566370614359172
TimeBetSnapshot                    0.5
TimeOfFirstSnapshot                0
TimeBegin                          0
TimeBetStatistics                  0.5
BoxSize                            1
GravityConstantInternal            1
MaxSizeTimestep                    0.025
MinSizeTimestep                    1e-10
ErrTolIntAccuracy                  0.005
ErrTolTheta                        0.5
ErrTolForceAcc                     0.0025
CourantFac                         0.4
MaxRMSDisplacementFac              0.125
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency          0.1
DesNumNgb                          32
MaxNumNgbDeviation                 1
MaxMemSize                         1000
PartAllocFactor                    2.5
BufferSize                         100
ResubmitOn                         0
ResubmitCommand                    none
CpuTimeBetRestartFile              1e9
Softening_Type0                    1e-3
Softening_Type1                    1e-3
Softening_Type2                    1e-3
Softening_Type3                    1e-3
Softening_Type4                    1e-3
Softening_Type5                    1e-3
Softening_Type0_MaxPhysLimit       1e-3
Softening_Type1_MaxPhysLimit       1e-3
Softening_Type2_MaxPhysLimit       1e-3
Softening_Type3_MaxPhysLimit       1e-3
Softening_Type4_MaxPhysLimit       1e-3
Softening_Type5_MaxPhysLimit       1e-3
